        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://travelbytrait.com/mashantucket-ct-visitor-guide/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Mashantucket Pequot Museum offers cultural programs like the Reclaiming the Waterways Mission and the Mishoon Dugout Canoe exhibit.",
